{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have all the evidence I need. The article (d32, balletrising.com, dated 2021-03-03) is an early 2020s article about Zama Dance School, which was founded in 1984 (1980s) in Gugulethu and started in a church hall. The article clearly states that Vuyokazi (Vuyo) is the school's secretary and the longest-serving employee.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"answer\": \"According to the early 2020s article (Ballet Rising, 3 March 2021) about Zama Dance School — which was founded in 1984 in Gugulethu and started in a church hall — the longest-serving employee at the school is Vuyokazi (referred to as \\\"Vuyo\\\"), and her role is the school's secretary. The article states: \\\"I must also mention Vuyokazi, the school's secretary. Thank goodness for Vuyo who worked alongside Arlene for many years. She is our longest serving employee and a valuable part of the team today.\\\"\", \"refs\": [\"e2\"]}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_dd8100f34f5a44b3ae84abf0","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789481361,"id":"chatcmpl-2a4d23c1-4e63-9cb4-b844-424d66e5d6af","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":13222,"completion_tokens":234,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":13456,"cached_tokens":3456,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3456},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}